Subtropis

Subtropis iku wewengkon &lt;a href="Bumi"&gt;Bumi&lt;/a&gt; sing ana ing lor lan kidul sawisé wewengkon &lt;a href="tropis"&gt;tropis&lt;/a&gt; sing diwatesi déning &lt;a href="garis%20walik%20lor"&gt;garis walik lor&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="garis%20walik%20kidul"&gt;garis walik kidul&lt;/a&gt; ing lintang 23,5° lor lan kidul. Kaanan iklim subtropis diwernani kanthi gangguan lan alangan saka alam kaya déné &lt;a href="badai"&gt;badai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="udan%20salju"&gt;udan salju&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="tornado"&gt;tornado&lt;/a&gt;. Laladan mawa iklim subtropis duwé 4 mangsa ya iku &lt;a href="mangsa%20semi"&gt;mangsa semi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mangsa%20panas"&gt;mangsa panas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mangsa%20palastra"&gt;mangsa palastra&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="mangsa%20adhem"&gt;mangsa adhem&lt;/a&gt;. Papat mangsa iki duwé karakteristik dhéwé-dhéwé, kanthi &lt;a href="suhu%20maksimal"&gt;suhu maksimal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="minimal"&gt;minimal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kalembaban"&gt;kalembaban&lt;/a&gt;, uga kaanan makluk urip sing béda.
Laladan subtropis ing wilahan bumi lor njangkep wewengkon:
<ul>
<li>Sapérangan gedhé &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt;, kejaba &lt;a href="Skandinavia"&gt;Skandinavia&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Kawasan &lt;a href="Asia%20Tengah"&gt;Asia Tengah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Asia%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Asia Wétan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Asia%20Kulon"&gt;Asia Kulon&lt;/a&gt; sisih lor.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; lan saubengé.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Afrika%20Lor"&gt;Afrika Lor&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
Laladan subtropis ing pérangan kidul njangkep wewengkon:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Pérangan kidul &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Kidul"&gt;Amérika Kidul&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
